# Parent submodule gitlinks

This repo only records SHAs for `backend` and `frontend`.

After you push a child `main`, `git add` that submodule here, commit `chore: bump <name> submodule`, and push parent `main`. Done when `git submodule status` matches the child's `origin/main`.
